  "historyNote": "#5349, INTERIM, eff 3-10-92, EXPIRED 7-8-92 New. #5461, eff 9-3-92, EXPIRED 9-3-98 New. #6866, INTERIM, eff 10-7-98, EXPIRED 2-4-99 New. #6994, eff 5-7-99; ss by #8882, INTERIM, eff 5-5-07, EXPIRES: 11-1-07; ss by #8996, eff 9-28-07",
